@h1alexbel Suddenly, we can't get rid of Java 8. Actually we started this project with Java 11 and then realised that we [need Java 8 as well](https://github.com/objectionary/jeo-maven-plugin/issues/610).  So, what I suggest is to configure `pom.xml` the way to use different versions of `qulice` based on the current Java version. 

[Here](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/34603742/maven-build-profile-activation) is how you can achieve this.

What do you think?
